  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "Acer palmatum 'Elena Melodi' Rare Japanese Maple Zones 5-9 Acer palmatum ‘Elena Melodi’ is an elegant Japanese maple selection by Dick van der Maat of the Netherlands. This cultivar develops into a compact, upright tree, reaching approximately 6–8 feet in height in 10 years, making it well suited for smaller landscapes and garden spaces. Its standout feature is its striking fall display, with foliage transitioning through warm orange tones into vibrant reds, adding strong seasonal interest and color to the garden."
  },
